Move /delay-shutdown below connection token validation gate

The /delay-shutdown endpoint was handled before the connection token
check, allowing unauthenticated cross-origin requests to reset the
idle shutdown timer (CSRF). Move it below the token gate so that
requests without a valid connection token are rejected with 403.

